ysabah.com/arts-culture/2014/03/03/macedonian-channels-fight-over-rights-to-turkish-series\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d69\"},\"ref\":\"d69\",\"snippet\":\" ... In terms of proportions, the most popular and classic narration is that Osman is the grandson of Süleyman Şah, who died drowning while crossing the Euphrates River on horseback. The Turkish historian Yılmaz Öztuna considers that Osman's grandfather, and Ertuğrul's father, is called Gündüz Alp, saying ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Osman_I\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d89\"},\"ref\":\"d89\",\"snippet\":\" ... 5 Wives\\n\\nLegendary film director John Huston, pictured here in the 1980s, was married five times. Four of his marriages ended in divorce. His fourth wife, Soma, died during their marriage. Huston, who died in 1987, had three children, including actors Anjelica Huston and Danny Huston. He also ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbsnews.com/pictures/much-married-celebs/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d90\"},\"ref\":\"d90\",\"snippet\":\" ... She died, probably of cancer, and she actually outlived both Henry and all of his other wives.\\n\\nThe Fifth Wife: Catherine Howard\\n\\nName: Catherine Howard\\n\\nMarriage Dates: 1540–1541\\n\\nChildren: None\\n\\nCatherine Howard (c. 1523–1542) was Henry VIII's fifth wife. She was also Anne Boleyn's ... \",\"title\":\"https://study.com/academy/lesson/henry-vii-the-kings-great-matter-and-the-succession-acts.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d91\"},\"ref\":\"d91\",\"sni